    "title": "Calmer status signals and sharper outage investigations",
    "intro": "A focused observability day for Aura: the public status surface stops flapping on slow snapshot refreshes, and the tooling that finds the offending code during an incident now ranks product code ahead of the framework itself.",
    "entries": [
      {
        "batch_id": "entry-1",
        "time_label": "7:26 AM",
        "started_at": "2026-06-16T14:26:04.000Z",
